# What the lint job installs. pre-commit manages the environment of every hook
# itself, so the runner is the only thing pinned here.
#
# lint.txt is compiled from this file and is what the workflow installs.
# Dependabot watches this directory and bumps the compiled file. A version
# written inside a `run:` line is invisible to it, which is why the pin lives
# here.
#
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --no-header \
#     --output-file=.github/requirements/lint.txt .github/requirements/lint.in
pre-commit
